Protea dependency
=================

Protea is an Architecture Description Language (ADL) based on Ruby
for defining and simulating CPU architectures.

Repository: https://github.com/ProteusLab/Protea
Branch:      gem5-integration

To clone:
    git clone --branch gem5-integration --depth 1 \
        https://github.com/ProteusLab/Protea.git ext/protea/Protea

Protea bundles its own copy of the LIRA Ruby library in lib/lira/.
If you also have ext/lira/LIRA/ cloned, you can symlink Protea's
bundled copy to use the canonical version:

    rm -rf ext/protea/Protea/lib/lira
    ln -s ../../lira/LIRA/ruby/lira ext/protea/Protea/lib/lira
